{
  "assessment_scope": "Supplemental Design Review of the complete current104-subject/24-model package. Packaging is the sole changed original member; its full contents and affected Installation/CLI/Release interfaces were reassessed. The other103 subjects match the original independently approved design-review-final member map exactly and retain affirmative unaffected scope as explained here. Upstream proposal-review remains current. This new review establishes current cumulative Design authority; original design-review-final keeps its original subjects/judgment and stale current applicability. The revised Plan is a separate Delivery judgment, not a Design package member.",
  "change_id": "2026-09-17-complete-model-test-coverage",
  "contributors": [
